'''Silversnow''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in [[Snowhill]]. He is an elderly man who has been waiting in front of the [[Crystal Barrier]] for hundreds of years. He waited for the Crystal Barrier to open, and to finally be reunited with the [[Elves]] on the other side. Silversnow carried a box of fruitcake he had prepared for the Elves' return.

==Trivia==
*Silversnow were supposed get to see the Elves, but it never happened before the game shut down.
